Revision history for ANSILL

{{$NEXT}}
  - First release of the ANSILL layout language compiler
  - Compiles a declarative text-mode layout (parse, resolve, render, validate, emit) to a 2D cell grid
  - Backends for ANSI escape sequences, plain text, JSON and HTML
  - JSON backend writes width, height and colours as JSON numbers
  - Unicode, CP437 and ASCII profiles
  - Command line tool "ansill" with compile, validate and info
